    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">Strength and minimum detailing; revise/recalculate after selecting weld [in]</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
      <dynexp formula="v_0645 = Round(16*v_0644, 0)" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="True" showsteps="False">
